---
// returns.astro - WNCPARTSLINGERS Return & Refund Policy
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Return & Refund Policy | WNCPARTSLINGERS</title>
    <meta name="description" content="30-day return window, refund procedures, and condition requirements for WNCPARTSLINGERS vintage automotive components." />
    <!-- Open Graph & Social / SMS Previews -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://wncpartslingers.com/returns" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Return & Refund Policy | WNCPARTSLINGERS" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="30-day return window, refund procedures, and condition requirements for WNCPARTSLINGERS vintage automotive components." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://wncpartslingers.com/og-banner.jpg" />
    <meta property="og:image:secure_url" content="https://wncpartslingers.com/og-banner.jpg" />
    <meta property="og:image:type" content="image/jpeg" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="WNCPARTSLINGERS - NOS Auto Parts & Accessories" />

    <!-- Twitter Card -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:url" content="https://wncpartslingers.com/returns" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Return & Refund Policy | WNCPARTSLINGERS" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="30-day return window, refund procedures, and condition requirements for WNCPARTSLINGERS vintage automotive components." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://wncpartslingers.com/og-banner.jpg" />

    <meta name="p:domain_verify" content="84b06eac7f89764d1148798575c74a4a" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header & Navigation -->
    <header class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <span class="highlight">WNC</span>PARTSLINGERS
        </a>
        <nav>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/#catalog">Catalog</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="/shipping">Shipping</a></li>
                <li><a href="/returns" class="active">Returns</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">eBay Store</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i> eBay Storefront
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="pdp-container" style="max-width: 850px; padding: 40px 20px;">
        <span class="tagline">// GUARANTEE & RETURNS</span>
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px;">Return & Refund Policy</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px;">Effective Date: October 16, 2026 · 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee on Verified Automotive Components</p>

        <!-- Summary Badge Box -->
        <div style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--accent-neon); padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; border-radius: 4px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: var(--accent-neon); font-size: 1.3rem;"></i>
                <strong style="color: var(--text-main); font-size: 1.1rem;">Store Return Acceptance: YES</strong>
            </div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
                WNCPARTSLINGERS gladly accepts returns on all catalog items. Customers enjoy a <strong>full 30-day return window</strong> beginning on the date of carrier delivery confirmation, ensuring your return period never expires prior to physical receipt of your package.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">1. 30-Day Return Window</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
                We stand 100% behind the authenticity, mechanical integrity, and catalog descriptions of our parts. You may return any eligible item within <strong>30 calendar days</strong> starting from the timestamp the delivery carrier marks your order as delivered.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">2. Step-by-Step Return Initiation Process</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px;">Initiating a return is simple and straightforward:</p>
            <ol style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 24px; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li><strong>Via Email:</strong> Email our dedicated support desk at <a href="mailto:parts@wncpartslingers.com" style="color: var(--accent-neon); font-weight: bold;">parts@wncpartslingers.com</a> with your order number, part number (MPN), and reason for return.</li>
                <li><strong>Via eBay Order Center:</strong> If purchased through our eBay storefront, go to your <em>Purchase History</em>, select the item, and click <em>"Return this item"</em>.</li>
                <li><strong>RMA Authorization & Label:</strong> Within 12 hours, our support desk will provide return confirmation and shipping instructions (including a prepaid shipping label for defective/mismatched items).</li>
                <li><strong>Dispatch Package:</strong> Securely package the part in sturdy protective packaging and hand it to USPS or UPS.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">3. Return Shipping Costs & Zero Restocking Fees</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.7;">
                <strong>Damaged, Defective, or Incorrect Item:</strong> In the rare event that an item arrives damaged in transit or differs from our catalog listing, WNCPARTSLINGERS covers 100% of return shipping costs with a prepaid carrier shipping label.
            </p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
                <strong>Buyer Remorse / Ordered by Mistake:</strong> If an item was ordered by mistake or is no longer needed, the buyer provides return shipping. We charge <strong>zero restocking fees ($0.00)</strong> on all eligible returns.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">4. Item Condition Guidelines</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px;">Because New Old Stock (NOS) parts are unrepeatable historic components, returned items must satisfy the following condition criteria:</p>
            <ul style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li>Item must be <strong>uninstalled, unaltered, and unmounted</strong> with no signs of installation damage, thread cross-threading, or grease.</li>
                <li>Must include all original factory packaging, manufacturer blister packs, header cards, and included mounting hardware as originally delivered.</li>
                <li>Items designated as factory-sealed must remain unopened for a full refund.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">5. Expected Processing Timelines & Reimbursement</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
                Once your return package arrives at our Hendersonville warehouse:
            </p>
            <ul style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 24px; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li><strong>Warehouse Inspection:</strong> Completed within <strong>1 business day</strong> of physical delivery.</li>
                <li><strong>Refund Issuance:</strong> Processed within <strong>2 business days</strong> back to your original payment method.</li>
                <li><strong>Funds Availability:</strong> Banks and credit card issuers typically credit the funds to your account within 2–5 business days depending on financial institution policies.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">6. Questions or Return Assistance</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                Our customer service team is standing by to help with any return questions or fitment checks.
            </p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">
                Email: <a href="mailto:parts@wncpartslingers.com" style="color: var(--accent-neon); font-weight: bold;">parts@wncpartslingers.com</a> · Phone: <a href="tel:+18286710816" style="color: var(--accent-neon); font-weight: bold;">(828) 671-0816</a> · Warehouse: Hendersonville, NC 28792
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 WNCPARTSLINGERS. Built for automotive restorers and performance technicians. · <a href="/about">About Us</a> · <a href="/shipping">Shipping Policy</a> · <a href="/returns">Return Policy</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> · <a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">eBay Store</a></p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
